                                            THE COMPANY. 3. TO HOLD AN ADVISORY VOTE APPROVING THE FOLLOWING RESOLUTION ENDORSING OUR
                                            EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION: "RESOLVED, THAT THE STOCKHOLDERS APPROVE THE COMPENSATION OF THE
